{"name":"Antigua Sunrise","hex":"#ffe7c8","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"sunrise","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The time of day when the sun appears above the eastern horizon.","The change in color of the sky at dawn."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To phase in.","To awake."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sunrise"}],"entries":[{"title":"Antigua","blocks":[{"text":"Antigua is an island in the Lesser Antilles. It is one of the Leeward Islands in the Caribbean region and the most populous island of the country of Antigua and Barbuda. Antigua and Barbuda became an independent state within the Commonwealth of Nations on 1 November 1981."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Antigua.JPG/330px-Antigua.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antigua","wikidata":"Q316390"},{"title":"Sunrise","blocks":[{"text":"Sunrise is the moment when the upper rim of the Sun appears on the horizon in the morning, at the start of the Sun path. The term can also refer to the entire process of the solar disk crossing the horizon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg/330px-Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunrise","wikidata":"Q193294"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/TurnerBeachAntigua.JPG/500px-TurnerBeachAntigua.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/TurnerBeachAntigua.JPG/1280px-TurnerBeachAntigua.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/TurnerBeachAntigua.JPG/500px-TurnerBeachAntigua.JPG?utm_s